# Daily Auto Industry Monitor

This project runs on GitHub Actions every day and builds a two-layer automotive intelligence workflow:

1. Source collection
2. Analysis and structuring

## Current source groups

The collection layer is aligned to the four source buckets you confirmed:

1. News aggregators
2. Official brand newsrooms and websites
3. Industry media
4. Sales bulletin sources

The source settings live in `config/monitor_config.json`.
The official-source group also includes an expanded set of brand-owned domains for mainstream China EV brands and key benchmark automakers.

## Brand coverage

The default watchlist now focuses on mainstream China EV brands plus a small set of traditional benchmark brands.

China EV-focused brands currently include:

